WEBVTT

NOTE RJ Tech bilingual subtitles — Chinese above, English below.

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.800
将动力线束放到视频所示位置。
Position the power harness as shown in the video.

2
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:19.800
使用随附的 Φ16 抱箍固定线束。
Secure the harness with the supplied 16 mm clamp.

3
00:00:30.095 --> 00:00:36.795
用 M6 螺母锁紧抱箍。
Tighten the clamp with an M6 nut.

4
00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:52.470
接下来安装后驱动力线。
Next, install the rear-drive power leads.

5
00:01:00.005 --> 00:01:10.005
核对端子标记后，将第一根动力线接到左后驱正极。
After checking the terminal marking, connect the first power lead to the left rear-drive positive terminal.

6
00:01:10.705 --> 00:01:16.605
按视频所示，使相邻线鼻保持约 90°。
Orient the adjacent cable lugs approximately 90 degrees apart, as shown.

7
00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:30.678
将另一根动力线布置到右后驱正极。
Route the other power lead to the right rear-drive positive terminal.

8
00:01:35.205 --> 00:01:40.805
同样使两只线鼻保持约 90°。
Again, keep the two adjacent cable lugs approximately 90 degrees apart.

9
00:01:43.478 --> 00:01:50.278
按部件端子标记锁紧左后驱连接。
Tighten the left rear-drive connection according to the component terminal marking.

10
00:01:51.378 --> 00:01:56.265
将另一端连接并锁紧到右后驱的对应端子。
Connect and tighten the other end at the matching right rear-drive terminal.

11
00:02:05.148 --> 00:02:08.448
打开驱动器端子防尘盖。
Open the drive-terminal protective covers.

12
00:02:11.768 --> 00:02:20.003
将左右后驱的对应动力线接好。
Connect the corresponding power leads to the left and right rear drives.

13
00:02:20.003 --> 00:02:23.003
听到卡嗒声表示接插件已到位。
A click confirms that the connector is fully seated.

14
00:02:23.003 --> 00:02:32.518
将左后驱线束与左后电机对接。
Connect the left rear-drive harness to the left rear motor.

15
00:02:35.718 --> 00:02:46.718
将右后驱线束与右后电机对接。
Connect the right rear-drive harness to the right rear motor.

16
00:02:50.932 --> 00:02:59.432
将驱动器三孔接插件与整车线束对接。
Mate the drive three-pin connector with the vehicle harness.
